    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fresh Twist On Classic Block-Pushing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gemima</strong>\u00a0brings infuriatingly compelling couch co-op to the classic Sokoban genre! Turns out life in four directons isn't<i> necessarily</i> simpler...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Twice The Challenge, Twice The Fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend (or play solo for a true test of dexterity!) and take control of apprentices Gemima and Jules in their quest to gather gemstones from the Mine of Mages. They'll have to work together closely to overcome the many traps and obstacles, and use their magical affinities (helpfully depicted by their hair colour) to dig, push, and collect their way to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Against The Clock - Or Not</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and think things through - or for the ultimate challenge, coordinate to solve each level before the Mage Mining Company blows the tunnels sky-high.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oodles Of Levels - And A Map To Explore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles have more than one solution, and each will take you in a different direction. Can you find every nook and cranny of the mine?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op On One Keyboard Or Controller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gemima</strong>'s simple controls mean two players can share a keyboard or controller. Although that<i> will</i>\u00a0put you within easy reach when you make a mistake...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fresh Twist On Classic Block-Pushing Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gemima</strong>\u00a0brings infuriatingly compelling couch co-op to the classic Sokoban genre! Turns out life in four directons isn't<i> necessarily</i> simpler...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Twice The Challenge, Twice The Fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend (or play solo for a true test of dexterity!) and take control of apprentices Gemima and Jules in their quest to gather gemstones from the Mine of Mages. They'll have to work together closely to overcome the many traps and obstacles, and use their magical affinities (helpfully depicted by their hair colour) to dig, push, and collect their way to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Against The Clock - Or Not</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and think things through - or for the ultimate challenge, coordinate to solve each level before the Mage Mining Company blows the tunnels sky-high.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oodles Of Levels - And A Map To Explore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles have more than one solution, and each will take you in a different direction. Can you find every nook and cranny of the mine?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op On One Keyboard Or Controller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gemima</strong>'s simple controls mean two players can share a keyboard or controller. Although that<i> will</i>\u00a0put you within easy reach when you make a mistake...</p>",
